{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f317a4313c8391be3ec272b19453fb539e31117b2ebbfd6b86b02c7ab13dfd03",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8691ad273d6bd139e55af6013ee31565e74b02cb45120b48a41168ae171cd3f",
      "text": "主治医生的见解",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23baca96fd950d5a32557155dff81f316bffe493a1bc80f0ff1609865dcb1e68",
      "text": "节假日加班的制作人，\n在事务所遇到了同样休假的薰。\n薰说他是来拿活动剧本的。\n正在交谈时，熬夜工作的制作人\n感到一阵轻微眩晕……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000013:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000013:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8691ad273d6bd139e55af6013ee31565e74b02cb45120b48a41168ae171cd3f",
      "text": "主治医生的见解",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92e0af274eb608d0a99a8d99e6207c8efb428a27e51b1aacae71c546871b81fa",
      "text": "……早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80def97ad30845c0cf3da3bad144db3c6f864e0923d47f3d8c1ce114dc7ed109",
      "text": "啊，薰先生。\n早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:488d1383b58addebb13fa81b9d641e7bfbdbf0db14c668bb1b4340ca129d2703",
      "text": "怎么了吗？\n薰先生今天应该休息才对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9465cc7993b1771f86d6e1e19f4cdff6339fcca373f9787082ab95d77a8ef78f",
      "text": "我只是来拿活动剧本的。\n你之前不是说今天早上会送达吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9dbb2e1044cdee1d858476a017aa6dddfb1ee121e0756087a3d2e97834d9f59",
      "text": "是这样的。\n已经送到了，请拿好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df7863eb9d44e5e75276249a08877245deb44db0687a928c92a9456fae231428",
      "text": "倒是你，为什么在事务所？\n今天你应该也是休息才对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77b48a6940a542c939bb380fcad5e5a054d8627a2fb3250d27b056ec60f13219",
      "text": "因为有几项工作想在\n本周内处理完。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9adf8e52b1269e9ae6ed2cac25dd7f1c3a0f08ee0e5e5d627b04573304a459e",
      "text": "真是的……\n最近加班是不是已经成常态了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05b515214cf47b6993ad1d70df861d6a321f10ba1cb2474098a5b4bb40dd1884",
      "text": "健康管理也是工作的一部分。\n要是你倒下了，困扰的人可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41a8cb844cc7abd1c6fb3cf4f7aef3abc17361be89fe9624d04ba515bcbdfd09",
      "text": "（……哎、奇怪？头晕……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1db7ffac11500c3df668e1d027c4f7498a4d008c8899e4ea16cd6e0019ce007",
      "text": "……！\n喂！●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ff3ffe4c7ef9077b96364399ae1067b0fbb896966519879ab6125150ac42f39",
      "text": "……真是让人操心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f4ed4be17f34a310c5a315de408d384cda06ff72302aad751d0b97a91e18369",
      "text": "不好意思。\n因为熬夜让您担心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db424ffbce7ceeee4f897be9dcc20a013469f7591ff84245708662a7059a7fdf",
      "text": "别以为只是单纯的睡眠不足就掉以轻心。\n从今以后，睡眠也要保证充足。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0295ac12d35af9eb522a4daa646c5e369ea5f88776a464a05ed31c662ebc82f",
      "text": "好的……真惭愧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9806f47f9392bf36bb45c3bfd1723399d9d9af84ad786a0ae91c3038552d7823",
      "text": "把这个拿去用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cebd971907c897f8f621efc2c6831bdaf717ab1ca6eee04f6e679484834bc038",
      "text": "……？毛毯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e92768bd91a6dcdc66bb92a3a2531e7453260a396293509efb86a54632cf542e",
      "text": "去沙发上稍微睡一会儿吧。\n……不管工作完没做完，都去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:824e3a2f8a846568216faa4cdb45eea911b5f3b65ef243b07903d9279142ee29",
      "text": "（……呜，一躺下来睡意排山倒海地涌上来了……\n听薰先生的话，稍微睡一会儿吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:498275c264a09b8e4119153d8816b19ce54ea95ae859394551b3be7e1c4e5b32",
      "text": "（咦？薰先生要去哪里呢。\n是要回去了吗。嘛，反正事情也办完了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ee4d1acf9e63e659b139f240133a9717543133bbd3d0d99266071b2429aa686",
      "text": "……呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_c:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa22146ec4f18a54f1a5cbce594b9284b167a204fde45c346c7b3b5345412819",
      "text": "（嗯……？薰先生的声音……\n是在和谁通电话吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6f19b1d8b35dbc7b13e9f27e1d21f1adbc3e125089e68c6d2afc6c4338b98f1",
      "text": "……嗯。没问题。\n变更事项由我来转达吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15185bf2bef618f91f4d86442598df58ae3ee28b883bc1a8241a7624376ebab9",
      "text": "……好，我知道了。\n晚点再联系。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b23fd3c84e5462abe6fb459206eee98b0532830077da40c788a015d8477d304d",
      "text": "……嗯？醒了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e64e125808a96dde2a19fb68ef0dd77d824da3f5aeff111f2ea379579381713a",
      "text": "早上好。\n那个，刚才的电话是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b09281819ec84074727b1395e561adf4c1ee48cfdba61368f414d8bb9db6f8c",
      "text": "是山村君。我替你接下了带给你的口信。\n我记了备忘，稍后过目一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f4ec8a590a2ee1299a64b809e7557a9b37ad91d5be9a546f1501ee1a6dbc59b",
      "text": "这么照顾我……真的太感谢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5256d61bdd99f526cb3fb87abb0cdfd59af4e60c70494c067b6b427883127c56",
      "text": "无所谓。比起这个，身体感觉怎么样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:561be8083e0906a1b3629717ae7a4c1c935eef9a90cdbfae1178318cb8e3be3d",
      "text": "很好！稍微小憩了30分钟左右，\n感觉神清气爽多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ceb104f7573ab6c8a472a1d8b50c1140ea813544bcf18c16334dd5b9d8724483",
      "text": "看来确实如此。气色变好了。\n虽然谈不上充足，但能好好休息一下比什么都强。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20066411b72f5ba17a3318b6b66a80b85c293313f07b9984946f31b03cf0dbce",
      "text": "……咦？这个便利店塑料袋……\n是薰先生买来的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2553fc75f54a042a260c2cd5af215301400b3b2241903f25c8f525fe23813f6a",
      "text": "饭团、布丁，还有运动饮料……\n难道刚才出门，是为了去买这些吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a0a7deb1eeabeb3564ba02f6b3b006ef5918498596becdf59801e31a2b8e24f",
      "text": "我挑了些对肠胃负担比较轻的。\n那种程度的话应该吃得下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad46fd99a48d54ccf491eae84c7bf6f0745a2de965187c89e82a4e7fb8ad16b3",
      "text": "谢谢您！\n正好肚子饿了，太开心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3729a075afa68f8df1c3393001f4b9586657d01a05a58f8bd7684b145293cb11",
      "text": "你该不会想告诉我，熬了通宵之后，\n连顿正经饭都没吃吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be60dd565f5cce74d250cc39b71c4e55a207bb0909fa1fcfd766414a5d3aa817",
      "text": "……对不起。下次我会注意的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db9b1909bd075ade689f87a1e0279c8fa8a071c98533eeacfdf4590635a6533f",
      "text": "知道就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae7706b077044d4713c4221dcecfc861511bf5f38522f7fbe683656b0a5ce5b6",
      "text": "（薰先生开始看起剧本来了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97855ea669728f0d67d735d268cea5152e6b5ea8c843ac75dd34033d9e89daa5",
      "text": "……您还不回去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b52f69a98d54cc3c01da30ba76bc85d5c7031be1dbbea7c3ac01b712317e6bb9",
      "text": "……啊。我还打算再待一会儿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48773afb2d65a1cfbcdbbbe98e31eedb3c52dc1314764be73a2cd7a2ffe7ef01",
      "text": "你之后还要继续工作吧。\n为了防止你再次倒下，我就在这里盯着你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f27c53a0c924d790d58409fae79246c9662d8f88c1c3fc4da8969a844c167c54",
      "text": "不，太不好意思了。\n没必要为了我做到这种地步……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d606c1199fc1460c218239e82909dd4f6643630995db81246930fd0dd39930ad",
      "text": "我可不是为了你。\n是为了让我们的工作能够顺利进行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1384621fe9ad48e03b08d73d03f03c166ad621ea90b557822c789608747f7fb9",
      "text": "而且今天的事务所很安静。\n适合读剧本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c916b0a0b3b84d9dc52574f6e08436d7232d067af2e9da7f7d11ba8c20df899f",
      "text": "（是在顾虑我啊……真感激）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aad51f35f16399207a90c7bc460d83f0ab92323d5a1dbf05331f55e9dd5c5d2",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n那我去把剩下的工作做完。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e31acec8345f914206e4a21331c799fdfe322e8d4f7c925975641a4bc218ea0f",
      "text": "嗯。\n要是觉得不舒服，立刻告诉我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12020c3f6eff87ecd3918b1827c40ae40a96bef52d24762b680e55afa37b4314",
      "text": "好的，我知道了。\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d326948077012345b3c74330f14ff1cca4b5c71649700637116d22bd596fea97",
      "text": "（耳边传来了薰先生翻阅剧本的声音。\n为了让那份工作顺利成功，我也要加油！）",
